<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S11" title="In SABER: Uncovering Vulnerabilities in Safety Alignment via Cross-Layer Residual Connection" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">11 </span>Ethical Considerations</span></a></li>
